  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 71 + 32 × 2 - 63 ÷ 7 + (81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾ × 3 - 22 = 113\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the numbers :\n\nOption 1): 2 and 3\n\n71 + 32 × 2 - 63 ÷ 7 + (81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾ × 3 - 22 = 113 ⇒ 71 + 32 × 3 - 63 ÷ 7 + (81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾ × 2 - 22 = 113\n\n71 + 32 × 3 - 63 ÷ 7 +__** **____**(81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾**____** **__× 2 - 22 = 113\n\n71 + 32 × 3 - __**63 ÷ 7**__ + 3 × 2 - 22 = 113\n\n71 + __**32 × 3**__ - 9 + __**3 **____**× 2**__ - 22 = 113\n\n__**71 + 96 + 6**__ - 9 - 22 = 113\n\n__**173 - 9 - 22**__ = 113\n\n142 ≠ 113 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2): 32 and 22\n\n71 + 32 × 2 - 63 ÷ 7 + (81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾ × 3 - 22 = 113 ⇒ 71 + 22 × 2 - 63 ÷ 7 + (81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾ × 3 - 32 = 113\n\n71 + 22 × 2 - 63 ÷ 7 +__** **____**(81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾**____** **__× 3 - 32 = 113\n\n71 + 22 × 2 - __**63 ÷ 7**__ + 3 × 3 - 32 = 113\n\n71 + __**22 × 2**__ - 9 + __**3 **____**× 3**__ - 32 = 113\n\n__**71 + 44 + 9**__ - 9 - 32 = 113\n\n__**124 - 9 - 32**__ = 113\n\n83 ≠ 113 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3): 3 and 7\n\n71 + 32 × 2 - 63 ÷ 7 + (81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾ × 3 - 22 = 113 ⇒ 71 + 32 × 2 - 63 ÷ 3 + (81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾ × 7 - 22 = 113\n\n71 + 32 × 2 - 63 ÷ 3 +__** **____**(81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾**____** **__× 7 - 22 = 113\n\n71 + 32 × 2 - __**63 ÷ 3**__ + 3 × 7 - 22 = 113\n\n71 + __**32 × 2**__ - 21 + __**3 **____**× 7**__ - 22 = 113\n\n__**71 + 64 + 21**__ - 21 - 22 = 113\n\n__**156 - 21 - 22**__ = 113\n\n**113 = 113 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4): 71 and 22\n\n71 + 32 × 2 - 63 ÷ 7 + (81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾ × 3 - 22 = 113 ⇒ 22 + 32 × 2 - 63 ÷ 7 + (81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾ × 3 - 71 = 113\n\n22 + 32 × 2 - 63 ÷ 7 +__** **____**(81)⁽¹⁾/⁽⁴⁾**____** **__× 3 - 71 = 113\n\n22 + 32 × 2 - __**63 ÷ 7**__ + 3 × 3 - 71 = 113\n\n22 + __**32 × 2**__ - 9 + __**3**____** × 3**__ - 71 = 113\n\n__**22 + 64 + 9**__ - 9 - 71 = 113\n\n__**95 - 9 - 71**__ = 113\n\n15 ≠ 113 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
